<title>USA: Superior National delays 10-Q filing.</title>
<headline>Superior National delays 10-Q filing.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior National Insurance Group Inc said on Thursday it plans to delay filing its Form 10-Q for the quarter ended September 30, pending a review of a 10-Q report to be filed by Pac Rim Holding Corp.</p>
<p>Superior National is in an agreement to acquire Pac Rim for about $54 million cash.</p>
<p>Superior National said it will complete its 10-Q, including a discussion of the pro forma financial data of Pac Rim, as soon as Pac Rim's 10-Q for the period ending September 30 is made available.</p>
</text>
